615
00:28:32.840 --> 00:28:35.400
I would watch, like, dark hour dramas and, like, weird movies.

616
00:28:35.620 --> 00:28:38.900
I could not, like, watch another comedy except The Office.

617
00:28:38.900 --> 00:28:41.660
I loved, and I watched in real time at the moment.

618
00:28:42.200 --> 00:28:44.040
But what is that for you guys?

619
00:28:44.040 --> 00:28:47.520
Were you guys able to, like, enjoy sitcoms while you were in one?

