00:28:47.900 --> 00:28:49.060
Yeah, I was.

621
00:28:49.260 --> 00:28:49.580
You were.

622
00:28:49.660 --> 00:28:50.080
That's good.

623
00:28:50.100 --> 00:28:50.640
I mean, oh, yeah.

624
00:28:50.840 --> 00:28:52.400
I watched Community.

625
00:28:53.160 --> 00:28:54.660
I watched Will and Grace.

626
00:28:55.180 --> 00:28:59.460
I watched 30 Rock, loved 30 Rock, Arrested Development.

627
00:29:00.240 --> 00:29:02.400
Yeah, I love comedy.

628
00:29:02.540 --> 00:29:06.840
So I was happy to come home and watch more people doing great comedy.

629
00:29:07.160 --> 00:29:07.700
That's great.

630
00:29:07.940 --> 00:29:09.840
I don't know what's wrong with me that I couldn't do it.

631
00:29:09.940 --> 00:29:10.940
Well, you're a creator.

632
00:29:10.940 --> 00:29:13.100
You're looking at it from a creator's point of view.

633
00:29:14.180 --> 00:29:18.640
I was, I was, I don't know why this is so, I look back now and I'm like, what was I doing?

634
00:29:18.660 --> 00:29:21.340
I was still doing improv theater in the evenings.

635
00:29:21.500 --> 00:29:22.360
I would have a show.

636
00:29:22.720 --> 00:29:23.260
Oh, my God.

637
00:29:23.720 --> 00:29:25.180
I mean, I'd be like, what am I doing?

638
00:29:25.400 --> 00:29:26.440
I remember those early seasons.

639
00:29:26.580 --> 00:29:30.980
I'd be so tired because we'd get done and then I'd be like, I got a nine o'clock show.

640
00:29:31.380 --> 00:29:32.520
I better go to your comedy now.

641
00:29:32.600 --> 00:29:34.700
You were doing The Office to support your improv habit.

642
00:29:37.420 --> 00:29:40.520
But yeah, and then I would watch shows here and there too.

643
00:29:40.740 --> 00:29:43.260
But I wasn't afraid to watch them though.

644
00:29:43.380 --> 00:29:44.580
