649
00:29:57.620 --> 00:30:01.160
It's like back in theater days when you're backstage with the different shows.

650
00:30:01.380 --> 00:30:07.360
And, and it felt, it felt smaller to me in the beginning because maybe because there wasn't

651
00:30:07.360 --> 00:30:11.720
streaming, maybe because we were on this tiny lot.

652
00:30:11.720 --> 00:30:14.020
We weren't even on a major studio lot, you know?

